    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Caravan Ribat sages",
        "Akademiya sages"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rushd"
      ],
      "comment": "Rushd: Irminsul Crisis Council",
      "content": "At Caravan Ribat, Naphis introduces the six sages: Baladhuri of Vahumana, Alkindi of Spantamad, Firnas of Kshahrewar, Shakir of Rtawahist and Rushd of Haravatat. Rushd tells the council that Nahida's role as Irminsul's information hub means the situation may be worse than they think, and that they should consider backup plans. Baladhuri asks if he means Irminsul being destroyed; Rushd replies only that the possibility exists. Later, he says that if the anomaly keeps growing the only option may be moving people to Aaru Village.",
